          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">3. Waypoint Graph &amp; Dijkstra Pathfinding</h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Instead of relying on Roblox built in PathfindingService, which operates on navigation meshes and can be unpredictable in complex multi floor environments, the system uses a hand authored waypoint graph with a custom Dijkstra implementation.<br><br><b>Graph Construction</b><br><br>Waypoints are physical parts placed in the world and connected through PathfindingLink attachments.<br><br>Intersection nodes with three or four connecting roads contain sub nodes for directional routing. This prevents NPCs from making illegal U turns at junctions.<br><br>Edge weights are calculated using Euclidean distances between connected waypoint positions during initialization.<br><br><b>The Algorithm</b><br><br>The pathfinding module builds an adjacency list at startup and resolves pathfinding queries using Dijkstra algorithm.<br><br><b>Why Dijkstra Instead of A Star</b><br><br>For a static waypoint graph containing fewer than 500 nodes, Dijkstra algorithm has negligible computational cost. Its time complexity is O of V squared in this implementation, which is acceptable for small graphs.<br><br>A star would require a consistent heuristic function tuned to the map layout. This would add complexity without a measurable benefit at this scale. A star remains a potential optimization for larger worlds.<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
