          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">9. Future Improvements</h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>Hierarchical Clustering and Pathfinding<br></b>For worlds with more than 1000 waypoints, partition the graph into districts and use Hierarchical Pathfinding A Star to reduce pathfinding costs.<br><br><b>Utility AI Layer</b><br>Replace the rigid schedule with a needs based system involving hunger, energy, and social needs. The system could dynamically select activities based on these needs.<br><br><b>Crowd Simulation</b><br>Add local avoidance using Reciprocal Velocity Obstacles or Optimal Reciprocal Collision Avoidance on top of waypoint navigation to improve movement in dense areas.<br><br><b>Event Driven Scheduling</b><br>Replace the polling loop with Lighting GetPropertyChangedSignal using ClockTime to reduce unnecessary polling and respond directly to time changes.<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
